    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "guide",
      "content": {
        "pros": [
          "Excellent team healing",
          "Reliable crowd control",
          "good self-survivability"
        ],
        "cons": [
          "Vulnerable to burst",
          "Limited engage",
          "Countered by antiheal"
        ],
        "gameplay_tips": "## Early Game\nIn the early game, use Skill 2 Earworm on enemies to deal damage and stun them when they want to walk up and last-hit minions. You can use Skill 2 when the enemy is trying to stand behind minions, and it will still bounce onto them, giving you super reliable damage and crowd control. When roaming, use Skill 1 Healing Hymn to give yourself movement speed so you are the first one on the rotations to help your team.\n\n## Teamfights\nIn teamfights, your main goal is to keep your Marksman and Mage alive. You have excellent aoe healing that can keep them both healthy at the same time. If assassins look to dive your carries, use your Ultimate early to give them defences to help them survive enemy burst. Skill 2 can also be used to crowd control the enemy that is trying to dive.\n\n## Tips & Tricks\nSkill 2 can bounce on minions and monsters to help reach enemy heroes\nYour Ultimate not only heals but also gives Physical and Magical defence, so don't leave it too late"
      }
    },
    {
      "source": "Kurohiko",
      "url": "https://hok.kurohiko.id/",
      "field": "tactical_tips",
      "content": "1) Assassin pick-off Cai Yan, dia lemah kalau sendirian. 2) Control skill 2-nya bisa dihindarin. 3) Pas dia ult, cari cara motong secepet mungkin."
    },
